            <div xml:id="d589">

                <pb facs="0603" n="591" sameAs="frus:frus1941v01/pg591"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 European War 1939/17488: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Rumania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Benton</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bucharest</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-12-12T20:00:00+02:00">December 12,
                            1941—8 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received December 13—11:16 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1040. The Secretary General of the Foreign Office has just summoned me and
                    delivered a <hi rendition="#italic">note verbale</hi> dated December 12, 1941,
                    the translation of which is as follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“The Royal Rumanian Government has the honor to communicate to the
                            Government of the United States of America that, in conformity with the
                            dispositions of the Tripartite Pact and respecting the obligations of
                            solidarity contained in this pact, as a result of the state of war which
                            has arisen between the United States of America on the one hand, and the
                            German Reich, Italy and Japan on the other, Rumania herself is in a
                            state of war with the United States of America.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Benton</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
